sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Menu as Menu
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Menu: updatePricing(basePrice, pricePerPerson, minGuests, maxGuests)
    Note over Menu: Policies: menuRead, menuWrite, menuExecute
    Note over Menu: Guards (3)
    Menu->>Menu: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;draft#quot; or self.status == #quot;published#quot;
    Menu->>Menu: guard[1]: self.deletedAt == null
    Menu->>Menu: guard[2]: roleAllows(user.role, #quot;kitchenManageAccess#quot;)
    Menu->>Menu: mutate.basePrice
    Menu->>Menu: mutate.pricePerPerson
    Menu->>Menu: mutate.minGuests
    Menu->>Menu: mutate.maxGuests
    Menu->>EventBus: emit MenuPricingUpdated on menu.pricing_updated
    Menu-->>-Client: void